<dialog id="privacy" class="policy" aria-labelledby="privTitle"><div class="pol-head"><h2 id="privTitle">Privacy Policy</h2><button type="button" id="privClose" aria-label="Close">×</button></div><div class="pol-body"><p class="upd">Last updated: October 26, 2026</p><h3>1. Who I am</h3><p>This website is run by Sujon Mahmud, a freelance Webflow developer based in Bangladesh. You can reach me at <a href="mailto:sujon.webflow@gmail.com">sujon.webflow@gmail.com</a>.</p><h3>2. Information I receive</h3><p><b>Information you give me.</b> When you use the contact form, the chat assistant, email or WhatsApp, I receive what you choose to share, such as your name, email address, phone number and project details.<br><b>Automatic information.</b> This site does not use analytics, advertising or tracking cookies. My hosting provider may keep standard technical logs (such as IP address and browser type) to keep the site secure and running.</p><h3>3. How I use it</h3><p>To reply to your enquiry, prepare quotes, deliver projects and keep a record of our communication. I do not sell your information and I do not use it for marketing without your permission.</p><h3>4. Contact form and chat assistant</h3><p>The chat assistant runs in your browser and answers from information on this site. If you share details with it, for example to request a quote, they are only used to prepare a message that you choose to send to me by WhatsApp or email. Nothing is sent until you tap the send button. If I later add a form-processing service or an AI backend to these features, I will update this policy.</p><h3>5. Third parties</h3><p>WhatsApp (Meta) and your email provider handle the messages you send me through them, under their own policies. Google Fonts supplies the DM Sans typeface, so your browser connects to Google’s servers and your IP address is visible to Google. Links to Fiverr, Upwork and client project websites lead to external sites with their own privacy policies.</p><h3>6. Cookies and browser storage</h3><p>This site does not set cookies of its own and does not store personal data in your browser.</p><h3>7. How long I keep information</h3><p>Enquiries and project communication are kept for as long as needed to respond, deliver the work and meet legal or accounting obligations, then deleted or anonymised.</p><h3>8. Your rights</h3><p>Depending on where you live (for example under the GDPR or UK GDPR), you may ask to access, correct or delete your personal information, restrict its use, or object to it. Email me and I will respond within a reasonable time.</p><h3>9. International use</h3><p>I am based in Bangladesh, so information you send me is processed there and by the services used to communicate, such as WhatsApp and email.</p><h3>10. Children</h3><p>This site is not directed at children under 16 and I do not knowingly collect their information.</p><h3>11. Security</h3><p>I take reasonable steps to protect your information, but no method of transmission over the internet is completely secure.</p><h3>12. Changes</h3><p>I may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top shows when it was last changed.</p><h3>13. Contact</h3><p>Questions about this policy or your data? Email <a href="mailto:sujon.webflow@gmail.com">sujon.webflow@gmail.com</a>.</p></div></dialog>